  "name": "Lamb Madras Curry",
  "subtitle": "Slow-simmered lamb with toasted spices, coconut, and tamarind",
  "description": "A rich, aromatic curry built from toasted whole spices, browned onion, coconut milk, curry leaves, and tender lamb.",
